# Commit the curated memory and the rendered transcripts; ignore the raw event
# logs and transient runtime state.
#
# Note the shape: `logs/` cannot be excluded wholesale, because git will not
# re-include anything under a directory it has already excluded. So exclude the
# CONTENTS of logs/, then carve the Markdown transcripts back out.
logs/*
!logs/transcripts/
logs/transcripts/*
!logs/transcripts/*.md
round
run
autonomy
python
